{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xuhuwang-e-cd94569616ca978c27e1","title":"王基谏止司马昭遣轻兵深入吴招唐咨子弟","accounts":[{"id":"xuhuwang-a-cd94569616ca978c27e1","label":"正文","text":"王基谏止司马昭遣轻兵深入吴招唐咨子弟","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-1f01423d70e6ab0ca952"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0034","role":"谏止进兵","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-1f01423d70e6ab0ca952"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"欲遣军后止","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-1f01423d70e6ab0ca952"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-1f01423d70e6ab0ca952"]},"ordering_evidence":"xuhuwang-q-1f01423d70e6ab0ca952","order":5398}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0034","name":"王基","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0045","name":"司马昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xuhuwang-q-1f01423d70e6ab0ca952","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-b25a885f68d037a9a139","layer":"original","quote":"文王欲遣诸将轻兵深入，招迎唐咨等子弟〖8〗，因衅有荡覆吴之势。基谏曰：“昔诸葛恪乘东关之胜，竭江表之兵，以围新城；城既不拔，而众死者太半。姜维因洮上之利〖9〗，轻兵，深入；粮饷不继，军覆上邽。夫大捷之后，上下轻敌；轻敌，则虑难不深。今贼新败于外，又内患未弭，是其修备设虑之时也。且兵出逾年，人有归志；今俘馘十万〖10〗，罪人斯得〖11〗。自历代征伐，未有全兵独克如今之盛者也。武皇帝克袁绍于官渡，自以所获已多，不复追奔，惧挫威也。”文王乃止。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":221,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
